{
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of Nagata's factoriality theorem for noetherian integral domains.  It proves that unique factorization descends from a localization when every denominator is a finite product of prime elements, packages the specialization to submonoids generated by sets of primes, and demonstrates the method with a Nagata-based polynomial UFD theorem.",
